{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "kiritani-sumire-post-20261119135311851",
      "model_id": "kiritani-sumire",
      "published_at": "2026-11-19T13:53:11.851+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "昼休みに古い画集を開いたら、ページの間から小さな展覧会の半券が出てきた。誰の思い出か分からないのに、ちょっと嬉しい。",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-rooftop-pool-sumire-011",
        "cut_id": "05",
        "image_sha256": "de24a1b682f3b49c394ce1121f0e4d68989fbf19f71477ab680358e5e54ed13d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kiritani-sumire-post-20261120143022174",
      "model_id": "kiritani-sumire",
      "published_at": "2026-11-20T14:30:22.174+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "午後、古い建物の窓枠がきれいな青緑で、手帳に「少し灰色」と書き足した。新しい服の差し色にできそう。帰りにもう一度見比べたい。",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-rooftop-pool-sumire-011",
        "cut_id": "01",
        "image_sha256": "0adb15a60cdc494ecec7c18939bf2ecaf223bda59b31ef1d456333c5763cc479"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kiritani-sumire-post-20261121140601481000",
      "model_id": "kiritani-sumire",
      "published_at": "2026-11-21T14:06:01.481+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "昼下がり、古道具屋で小さな真鍮の取っ手を見つけた。新しい棚に似合いそうで、店内を二周。まだ迷ってるんだけど。",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-rooftop-pool-sumire-011",
        "cut_id": "02",
        "image_sha256": "e09d33dbe03000e0dfe53a146d379eb20440b498782e2ebbe61ad589f3ec17ca"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kiritani-sumire-post-20261122141532365000",
      "model_id": "kiritani-sumire",
      "published_at": "2026-11-22T14:15:32.365+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "昼過ぎ、稽古場で古い衣装の裏地を見せてもらった。表よりずっと鮮やかな青。新しい上着にも使いたくなって、色見本を一枚だけ持ち帰った。",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-rooftop-pool-sumire-011",
        "cut_id": "03",
        "image_sha256": "9dbe0a8f4bf88cb675e9fd1244f9cc449ec69706000b745cd6710006aab77947"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kiritani-sumire-post-20261123135827352",
      "model_id": "kiritani-sumire",
      "published_at": "2026-11-23T13:58:27.352+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "午後、古い劇場の資料室で紐のかかったスケッチ帳を見せてもらった。舞台袖の光まで描かれていて、ページを閉じるのが少し惜しかった。",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-rooftop-pool-sumire-011",
        "cut_id": "06",
        "image_sha256": "ce3f082f9d399a5a2535412130d48a473c9485cb88136cb325b0e7e07bea561d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kiritani-sumire-post-20261124135010170",
      "model_id": "kiritani-sumire",
      "published_at": "2026-11-24T13:50:10.170+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "海沿いの売店で温かい紅茶を買った。紙袋の紺と白の組み合わせが妙にきれいで、捨てる前に配色だけ手帳に写した。",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-rooftop-pool-sumire-011",
        "cut_id": "08",
        "image_sha256": "ad2228fcc83b06bacefb4ed9f34307ccc26472fd97a9538f540cc9270a9e08f2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kiritani-sumire-post-20261125141106453",
      "model_id": "kiritani-sumire",
      "published_at": "2026-11-25T14:11:06.453+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "午後、温水プールの帰りに古い黒のショールを羽織った。茶色の水着に合わせたら意外としっくりきて、冬にも出番が増えそう。",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-rooftop-pool-sumire-011",
        "cut_id": "07",
        "image_sha256": "77e72dd4e8fdc17779632b66bceeaf0d9c740dfd5cb83f66b6717fba1a1940e2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kiritani-sumire-post-20261126142207932",
      "model_id": "kiritani-sumire",
      "published_at": "2026-11-26T14:22:07.932+09:00",
      "setting": {
        "year": 2031,
        "month": 11
      },
      "text": "午後、緑の布見本を窓辺に並べてみた。曇りの日の光だと、同じ緑でもずいぶん違う。二枚に絞るつもりが三枚残った。",
      "source": {
        "issue_slug": "november-rooftop-pool-sumire-011",
        "cut_id": "09",
        "image_sha256": "8c2153e0b862e3dc4e8b130171c097a336cea845aa08e49c2f972815ea0d4ab8"
      }
    }
  ]
}
